#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:19
msgid ""
"We respect your privacy. We will not sell or share your personal details, "
"including your name, your date of birth, your email address and your "
"password. Messages you send to people on Speedy Net are personal and will "
"not be shared with other people or websites. Your password is saved "
"encrypted on our database."
msgstr ""
"Kami menghormati privasi anda. Kami tidak akan menjual atau berkongsi "
"butiran peribadi anda, termasuk nama anda, tarikh lahir anda, alamat e-mel "
"anda dan kata laluan anda. Mesej yang anda hantar kepada orang di Speedy Net "
"adalah peribadi dan tidak akan dikongsi dengan orang atau tapak web lain. "
"Kata laluan anda disimpan disulitkan pada pangkalan data kami."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:21
msgid ""
"Your profile on Speedy Net is visible to everyone, but you can choose who to "
"share with your email address and your date of birth. If you signed up for "
"Speedy Match, your Speedy Match profile will only be visible to people who "
"match you according to the settings you have set up on the site, and that "
"you match them according to their settings. Your profile on Speedy Match "
"will not appear on Google and is not visible to people who are not "
"registered to the site."
msgstr ""
"Profil anda di Speedy Net kelihatan kepada semua orang, tetapi anda boleh "
"memilih siapa yang hendak dikongsi dengan alamat e-mel anda dan tarikh lahir "
"anda. Jika Speedy Match anda mendaftar untuk, profil Speedy Match anda hanya "
"akan kelihatan kepada orang yang memadankan anda mengikut tetapan yang telah "
"anda sediakan di tapak dan anda memadankannya mengikut tetapan mereka. "
"Profil anda di Speedy Match tidak akan muncul di Google dan tidak kelihatan "
"kepada orang yang tidak berdaftar ke tapak tersebut."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:23
msgid ""
"If you have deactivated your account on Speedy Net or Speedy Match, your "
"profile on that site will be removed from the site and you will not appear "
"in other people's search results on the site. Note that deactivating your "
"account on Speedy Net also automatically deactivates your account at Speedy "
"Match. You can deactivate only your account at Speedy Match, in which case "
"your Speedy Net account will remain active. You can reactivate your account "
"after you deactivate it whenever you like."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda telah menyahaktifkan akaun anda di Speedy Net atau Speedy Match, "
"profil anda di tapak tersebut akan dialih keluar daripada tapak dan anda "
"tidak akan muncul dalam hasil carian orang lain di tapak. Ambil perhatian "
"bahawa menyahaktifkan akaun anda di Speedy Net juga menyahaktifkan akaun "
"anda secara automatik di Speedy Match. Anda boleh menyahaktifkan hanya akaun "
"anda di Speedy Match, yang mana akaun Speedy Net anda akan kekal aktif. Anda "
"boleh mengaktifkan semula akaun anda selepas anda menyahaktifkannya pada "
"bila-bila masa yang anda suka."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:25
msgid ""
"If you want, you can delete your account on Speedy Net. Deleting your Speedy "
"Net account will automatically delete your Speedy Match account as well. To "
"delete your Speedy Net account, log in to Speedy Net, deactivate your "
"account, and then click “Delete Account” (in the “Edit Profile” menu). Fill "
"out the details in the form and confirm. Please note that a deleted account "
"cannot be recovered. Account deletion is permanent and irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda mahu, anda boleh memadamkan akaun anda di Speedy Net. Memadam "
"akaun Speedy Net anda secara automatik akan memadamkan akaun Speedy Match "
"anda juga. Untuk memadam akaun Speedy Net anda, log masuk ke Speedy Net, "
"nyahaktifkan akaun anda, dan kemudian klik \"Padam Akaun\" (dalam menu "
"\"Edit Profil\"). Isi butiran dalam borang dan sahkan. Sila ambil perhatian "
"bahawa akaun yang dipadam tidak boleh dipulihkan. Pemadaman akaun adalah "
"kekal dan tidak boleh dipulihkan."

